{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>Its lamps, the lamps of the מַעֲרָכָה</b>. It is conceivable that the manner of menorahs is to have on them lamps for ornament, or to multiply light through them at times, but such is not the case with the holy Menorah, for it had only the seven lamps. Therefore Scripture specifies <b>the lamps of the מַעֲרָכָה</b> — for they are those which one sets in order (מַעֲרִיךְ) between the evenings."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 39, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:19:43.942983845Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}